# Check out every text file with LF, whatever the client's core.autocrlf: gofmt, golangci-lint and the
# shell scripts require LF, and a Windows clone with autocrlf=true otherwise fails `make lint` on every
# Go file (found by the clean-room check, 2026-11-21).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
